<title>FRANCE: Chirac reaffirms commitment to Europe.</title>
<headline>Chirac reaffirms commitment to Europe.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac reaffirmed on Thursday his commitment to press ahead with plans for greater European integration.</p>
<p>&quot;This general principle can no longer be genuinely called into question,&quot; he told a New Year reception for the press.</p>
<p>The aim was to create conditions for lasting peace in Europe and build a pillar of growth and strength, he said,</p>
<p>He added that Europe could not build a large single market with many different currencies.</p>
<p>Chirac has regularly repeated his commitment to launching a single European currency in January 1999.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 mmd/pmc</p>
</text>
